/*
 * Lexer for macro-generated content.
 *
 * MacroLexer tokenizes the body of a macro. Unlike the standard source lexer,
 * this lexer operates on an in-memory string produced by the macro system.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::lexing::macro_::lexer
 * @File: ymirc/lexing/macro_/lexer.yr
